					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13793028#post-4790352</guid>
				<title>A Cosmic Cycle</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13793028/a-cosmic-cycle#post-4790352</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2020 01:21:36 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>LillithHollyMisato</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>6880118</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>There's so many people I'd like to thank for helping me get this on the site, I don't think I am able to list them all. I'd like to first thank the IRC chat and staff for being extremely helpful, and patient, in helping me learn the site layout, how to publish this, and how to write in the first place.<br /> I'd like to especially thank <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/anorrack" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4188420&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1602249785" alt="Anorrack" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4188420)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/anorrack" >Anorrack</a></span> for inspiring me with an offhand comment to even start o this article, and for being very helpful throughout the process.</p> <p>I would also like to thank:<br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cybersqyd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5336470&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1602249785" alt="cybersqyd" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5336470)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cybersqyd" >cybersqyd</a></span> for ver critiques, which helped me improve the concept drastically<br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaguepjp" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5813664&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1602249785" alt="PlaguePJP" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5813664)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaguepjp" >PlaguePJP</a></span> for critiquing and leading me to my first major revision<br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grigori-karpin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4558017&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1602249785" alt="Grigori Karpin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4558017)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grigori-karpin" >Grigori Karpin</a></span> for critiquing and leading me to change the article from an SCP to a GoI format, which I think turned out to be the best way to tell this story.<br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5045819&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1602249785" alt="Calibri Bold" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5045819)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" >Calibri Bold</a></span> for the first greenlight I've ever received on the site, at a time when I was wondering if I could really pull this off.<br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yellowislol" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6284593&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1602249785" alt="YellowISlol" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6284593)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yellowislol" >YellowISlol</a></span> for the critique on the anomalous nature of the Cosmos, which led to me trying to tie it in closer to the story.<br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/marcelles-raynes" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5722579&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1602249785" alt="Marcelles_Raynes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5722579)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/marcelles-raynes" >Marcelles_Raynes</a></span> for my second greenlight, allowing me to go forward.<br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/bluejones" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4646198&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1602249785" alt="BlueJones" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4646198)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/bluejones" >BlueJones</a></span> for the incredible kindness displayed towards me while I was working, and for believing in me.<br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/malycegraves" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4916887&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1602249785" alt="MalyceGraves" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4916887)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/malycegraves" >MalyceGraves</a></span> for helping me actually get this on the site.<br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/michaelwrighting" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5406693&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1602249785" alt="MichaelWrighting" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5406693)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/michaelwrighting" >MichaelWrighting</a></span> for giving one last look over on my draft, giving me the confidence I needed to finally post this onto the main site.<br /> and to the good folks on the Licensing Team for being patient with me and helping me navigate the minefield that is licensing.<br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wizzblizz" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6760712&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1602249785" alt="WizzBlizz" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6760712)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wizzblizz" >WizzBlizz</a></span> for reading the draft and critiquing it.</p> <p>I may have left a few people out, if you read my draft and critiqued it, and I forgot to mention you here, please inform me on IRC or via wikidot mail! Thank you!</p> 
				 	]]>
